<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMC Entertainment lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMC Entertainment lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns downgraded AMC Entertainment Inc to neutral from attractive, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- the stock was not immediately open after closing Thursday at 19-7/8.</p>
</text>
